<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Meet Greek Singles | Coming Soon</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Meet Greek Singles is coming soon. A refined space for meaningful Greek connections rooted in shared values, culture, and authenticity." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #183b74;
      --gold: #d4ad47;
      --gold-soft: rgba(212, 173, 71, 0.18);
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #f6f7fb;
      --muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      --overlay: rgba(12, 28, 57, 0.48);
      --overlay-strong: rgba(12, 28, 57, 0.62);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: #0c1c39;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background:
        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.06), rgba(255,255,255,0)),
        linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--overlay), var(--overlay-strong)),
        url('/_files/background.jpg') center center / cover no-repeat;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 32px 18px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), transparent 30%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 80% 25%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12), transparent 26%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%, rgba(212,173,71,0.10), transparent 24%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(100%, 920px);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(15, 33, 67, 0.38);
      backdrop-filter: blur(9px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(9px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      border-radius: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 38px 28px 34px;
    }

    .logo-wrap {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: min(100%, 430px);
      height: auto;
      display: inline-block;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.24));
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fff7df;
      background: var(--gold-soft);
      border: 1px solid rgba(212,173,71,0.33);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      margin: 8px 0 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 5.3vw, 4.7rem);
      line-height: 1.04;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--white);
      text-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 18px auto 0;
      max-width: 780px;
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.1vw, 1.55rem);
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 88px;
      height: 3px;
      margin: 28px auto;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(212,173,71,0.15), var(--gold), rgba(212,173,71,0.15));
    }

    .message {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 760px;
      font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.85vw, 1.28rem);
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
    }

    .message strong {
      color: #fff2c7;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .coming-soon {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fff2c7;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      body {
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 20px 14px;
      }

      .card {
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 26px 18px 24px;
      }

      .logo {
        width: min(100%, 300px);
      }

      .eyebrow {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .divider {
        margin: 22px auto;
      }

      .message {
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="card" aria-label="Meet Greek Singles coming soon announcement">
      <div class="logo-wrap">
        <img class="logo" src="_files/logo.png" alt="Meet Greek Singles" />
      </div>

      <div class="eyebrow">Coming Soon</div>

      <h1>Where Greek Hearts Meet</h1>

      <p class="subtitle">
        A refined space for meaningful connections, rooted in shared values, culture, and authenticity.
      </p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p class="message">
        We are currently preparing something special — a place where Greeks from around the world can connect in a genuine and meaningful way.
        <br><br>
        <strong>Our official launch is coming soon.</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="coming-soon">A beautiful new beginning is on its way</div>
      <p class="footer-note">With warmth from Greece 🇬🇷</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
